"https://www.mast.is/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir/adskotahlutur-i-orkustykki": "<html><body><main id=\"main\"><div id=\"news\" class=\"box\">\n\t<div class=\"boxTitle\"><h1>Aðskotahlutur í orkustykki</h1></div>\n        <div class=\"boxText\">\n\t\t<div class=\"entry hasImage  \">\n\t<div class=\"entryInfo\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"category\">Innkallanir - </span>\n\t\t<span class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t26.11.2026\t\t\t</span>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"entryContent\">\n\t\t<p>Matvælastofnun varar við neyslu á einni framleiðslulotu af Corny 0% Added sugar Chocolate Multi pack 6x20g sem Innnes ehf. flytur inn vegna málmhluta sem fannst í vöru. Fyrirtækið hefur í samráði við Heilbrigðiseftirlit Reykjavíkurborgar innkalla vöruna.</p>\n<p>Eingöngu er verið að innkalla eftirfarandi framleiðslulotu:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vörumerki: Corny</li>\n<li>Vöruheiti: 0% Added sugar Chocolate Multi pack 6x20g</li>\n<li>Nettómagn: 120 g</li>\n<li>Strikamerki: 4011800593063</li>\n<li>Best fyrir dagsetning: 10.09.2027</li>\n<li>Innflytjandi: Innnes ehf., Korngörðum 3, 104 Reykjavík</li>\n<li>Dreifing: Plúsmarkaðurinn, Hlíðarkaup, Fjarðarkaup, Corner Shop.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"/static/files/_blob/jvkpkm22uvf5tfl4c58c5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"411\"></p>\n<p>Neytendur sem eiga umrædda vöru eru beðnir um að neyta hennar ekki heldur farga henni. Einnig<br>er hægt að skila henni í versluninni þar sem hún var keypt og fá hana bætta.</p>\n<h2>Ítarefni</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/static/files/tilkynning-innkollun-a-corny-0_-added-sugar-chocolate-multi-pack-6x20g-med-bbd-10.09.2027.pdf\">Fréttatilkynning frá Innnes ehf.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/static/files/ft20_mher_innnes_corny_chocolate_multi_pack_0__23112026.pdf\">Fréttatilkynning frá Heilbrigðiseftirlitinu í Reykjavík</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/static/files/pressreleasecorny0addedsugarchocolatedkforviaritzau.pdf\">Fréttatilkynning frá framleiðanda&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mast.is/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir\">Listi Matvælastofnunar yfir innkallanir</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/matvaelastofnun/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Matvælastofnun á facebook</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"entryFooter\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"back\" href=\"/is/um-mast/frettir/frettir\">Fréttasafn</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<br class=\"clear\"/>\n\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bottomContent\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"helpful\">\n\t<form id=\"helpful_form\" enctype=\"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" class=\"moya_form m_gr_entry\" action=\"/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir/adskotahlutur-i-orkustykki\" method=\"post\">\n<div id=\"elm_url\" class=\"elm_hidden elm\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" value=\"/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir/adskotahlutur-i-orkustykki\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"url\"></div>\n<div id=\"elm_module\" class=\"elm_hidden elm\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"module\" value=\"-1\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"module\"></div>\n<div id=\"elm_extID\" class=\"elm_hidden elm\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"extID\" value=\"-1\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"extID\"></div>\n\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"m_gr_entry_token\" value=\"\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"m_gr_entry_token\">\n\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"m_gr_entry_category\" value=\"\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"m_gr_entry_category\">\n<fieldset id=\"fieldset_yesFieldset\"><legend>Getum við bætt efni síðunnar?</legend>\n\n<div id=\"elm_helpfulBtn\" class=\"elm_button elm\">\n<button name=\"helpfulBtn\" id=\"helpfulBtn\" type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Já</button></div>\n<div id=\"elm_helpful\" class=\"elm_hidden elm\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"helpful\" value=\"\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"helpful\"></div></fieldset>\n<fieldset id=\"fieldset_noFieldset\" style=\"display:none\"><legend>Ástæða</legend>\n\n<div id=\"elm_reason\" class=\"elm_radio elm\">\n<span class=\"lmnt\"><label for=\"reason