-3\" value=\"3\" aria-required=\"true\" class=\"radio \">Það er of mikið efni á síðunni</label><br /><label for=\"reason-4\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"reason\" id=\"reason-4\" value=\"4\" aria-required=\"true\" class=\"radio \">Ég skil ekki efnið, finnst það of flókið</label></span></div>\n<div id=\"elm_extra\" class=\"elm_textarea elm\"><label for=\"extra\" class=\"optional\">Eitthvað annað sem þú vilt koma á framfæri?</label>\n\n<span class=\"lmnt\"><textarea name=\"extra\" id=\"extra\" maxlength=\"350\" class=\"textarea \" rows=\"5\" cols=\"80\"></textarea></span></div>\n<div id=\"elm_helpful_cancel\" class=\"elm_button elm\">\n<button name=\"helpful_cancel\" id=\"helpful_cancel\" type=\"button\" class=\"submit\">Hætta við</button></div>\n<div id=\"elm_helpful_submit\" class=\"elm_button elm\">\n<button name=\"helpful_submit\" id=\"helpful_submit\" type=\"button\" class=\"submit\">Senda álit</button></div></fieldset></form>\t<div id=\"helpful-success\" style=\"display: none\">\n\t\t<div class=\"contentWrap\">\n\t\t\t<p>Takk fyrir!</p>\n\t\t\t<p>Ábending þín er móttekin</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"toolbox\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"/_/is/social/index/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.mast.is%2Fis%2Fum-mast%2Ffrettir%2Finnkallanir%2Fadskotahlutur-plast-i-jogurt&amp;title=A%C3%B0skotahlutur+%28plast%29+%C3%AD+j%C3%B3g%C3%BArt+%7C+Matv%C3%A6lastofnun&amp;description=Matv%C3%A6lastofnun+varar+vi%C3%B0+einni+framlei%C3%B0slulotu+af+%C3%96rnu+j%C3%B3g%C3%BArt+me%C3%B0+jar%C3%B0arberjum+og+AB-gerlum+fr%C3%A1+%C3%96rnu+ehf.+vegna+a%C3%B0skotahlutar+sem+fannst+%C3%AD+v%C3%B6runni.\" aria-label=\"Deila\"  class=\"shareThis\">\n\t\t\t<span>Deila síðu</span>\n\t\t\t<i class=\"fas fa-reply\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n\t\t</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:window.print()\">\n\t\t\t<span>Prenta síðu</span>\n\t\t\t<i class=\"fas fa-print\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>\n\t\t</a>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</main></body></html>",
"https://www.mast.is/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir/adskotaefni-yfir-morkum-i-faedubotarefnum": "<html><body><main id=\"main\"><div id=\"news\" class=\"box\">\n\t<div class=\"boxTitle\"><h1>Aðskotaefni yfir mörkum í fæðubótarefnum</h1></div>\n        <div class=\"boxText\">\n\t\t<div class=\"entry hasImage  \">\n\t<div class=\"entryInfo\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"category\">Innkallanir - </span>\n\t\t<span class=\"date\">\n\t\t\t\t\t15.09.2026\t\t\t</span>\n\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"entryContent\">\n\t\t<p>Matvælastofnun varar við neyslu á tveimur tegundum af fæðubótarefnum af vörumerkinu Guli miðinn frá Bretlandi sem Heilsa ehf. flytur inn vegna aðskotaefnisins pyrrolizidine alkalóíða sem mældist yfir mörkum. Fyrirtækið hefur innkallað vörurnar í samráði við Heilbrigðiseftirlit Reykjavíkur.</p>\n<p>Eingöngu er verið að innkalla eftirfarnar framleiðslulotur:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vörumerki: Guli miðinn</li>\n<li>Vöruheiti:<strong> Husk</strong></li>\n<li>Lotunúmer og best fyrir dagsetningar: Lota 25/16/11, best fyrir 12.06.2028; lota 25/24/11,<br>best fyrir 09.07.2028; lota 25/35/15, best fyrir<br>16.9.2028; lota 25/50/17, best fyrir 23.4.2029.</li>\n<li>Strikamerki: 5690684004446</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Vörumerki: Guli miðinn</li>\n<li>Vöruheiti: <strong>Colon Cleanser</strong></li>\n<li>Lotunúmer og best fyrir dagsetningar: Lota 25/5/59, best fyrir 23.04.2028; lota 061225,<br>best fyrir 10.09.2028.</li>\n<li>Strikamerki: 5690684000868</li>\n<li>Framleiðandi: Lifeplan</li>\n<li>Framleiðsluland: Bretland</li>\n<li>Innflytjandi: Heilsa ehf., Skarfagarðar 2, 104 Reykjavík</li>\n<li>Dreifing: Austurbæjarapótek, Apótek Garðabæjar, Borgar Apótek, Bæjarapótek, Lyfja, Krónan, Hagkaup,<br>Lyfjaver, Heilsuver, Apótekarinn, Lyfsalinn, Fjarðarkaup, Hlíðarkaup, Kaupfélag Vestur –<br>Húnvetninga, Siglufjarðarapótek, Þín verslun Kassinn, Urðarapótek</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Neytendur sem hafa keypt umræddar vörur eru beðnir um að hætta notkun þeirra og farga en<br>einnig má skila þeim í versluninni þar sem þær voru keyptar eða hjá Heilsu ehf.</p>\n<h2>Ítarefni</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/static/files/innkollun_husk_colon_14.09.2026.pdf\">Fréttatilkynning frá Heilsu ehf.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/static/files/ft15_mher_heilsa_gm_husk_og_colon_cleanser.pdf\">Fréttatilkynning frá Heilbrigðiseftirliti Reykjavíkur</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mast.is/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir\">Listi Matvælastofnunar yfir innkallanir</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/matvaelastofnun/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Matvælastofnun á facebook</a></li>\n</ul>\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"entryFooter\">\n\t\t\t\t<a class=\"back\" href=\"/is/um-mast/frettir/frettir\">Fréttasafn</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<br class=\"clear\"/>\n\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"bottomContent\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"helpful\">\n\t<form id=\"helpful_form\" enctype=\"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" class=\"moya_form m_gr_entry\" action=\"/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir/adskotaefni-yfir-morkum-i-faedubotarefnum\" method=\"post\">\n<div id=\"elm_url\" class=\"elm_hidden elm\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"url\" value=\"/is/um-mast/frettir/innkallanir/adskotaefni-yfir-morkum-i-faedubotarefnum\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"url\"></div>\n<div id=\"elm_module\" class=\"elm_hidden elm\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"module\" value=\"-1\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"module\"></div>\n<div id=\"elm_extID\" class=\"elm_hidden elm\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"extID\" value=\"-1\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"extID\"></div>\n\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"m_gr_entry_token\" value=\"\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"m_gr_entry_token\">\n\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"m_gr_entry_category\" value=\"\" class=\"hidden \" id=\"m_gr_entry_category\">\n<fieldset id=\"fieldset_yesFieldset\"><legend>Getum við bætt efni síðunnar?</legend>\n\n<div id=\"elm_helpfulBtn\" class=\"elm_button elm\">\n<button name=\"helpfulBtn\" id=\"helpfu